WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.475
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.427 --> 00:00:04.961
Maya's coins are leaking away, and she does not know why!

3
00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:08.099
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:10.432
This is Episode 71.

5
00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:12.267
Meet the wise turtle.

6
00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.688
The turtle walks around the whole town and checks everything.

7
00:00:15.688 --> 00:00:17.897
First card: the coin.

8
00:00:17.897 --> 00:00:21.012
That stand is lit all night with no customers.

9
00:00:21.012 --> 00:00:23.549
Turn it off, save your coins.

10
00:00:23.549 --> 00:00:25.961
Second card: the padlock.

11
00:00:25.961 --> 00:00:28.147
That back gate is wide open!

12
00:00:28.147 --> 00:00:29.428
Click.

13
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:30.730
Safe.

14
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.871
Third card: the heart.

15
00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:35.261
That stand has only one lamp.

16
00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:37.244
If it breaks, dark!

17
00:00:37.244 --> 00:00:38.931
Add a second one.

18
00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:41.400
The turtle does not fix things for you.

19
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.935
It just points, kindly, at what you should fix.

20
00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:47.698
That is AWS Trusted Advisor.

21
00:00:47.698 --> 00:00:52.184
It checks your cost, your safety, and your backups, and gives you tips.

22
00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:54.256
Now you know the wise turtle!

23
00:00:54.256 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

